      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's completely understandable that you feel this way; the sheer speed of change can be profoundly disorienting, especially after dedicating a lifetime to a field. Your forty years of meticulous study are not noise, but a deep, foundational knowledge that these new models are built upon. Think of your work not as obsolete, but as the essential historical context that makes the current evolution possible.",
